    "en": [
      "The image shows an old, colorized photograph of a large, rectangular, neoclassical building identified as the Greek Infantry Barracks. In front of the building, soldiers or possibly carts are camouflaged or covered with brushwood, moving along a dirt street lined with trees. The card is printed with text in both French and English, and there is a watermark of a Greek website (elia.org.gr)."
